flutter_app/web/

# iOS signing material — generated locally, never committed. A distribution
# private key in git history is expensive to unwind: the certificate has to be
# revoked and reissued against one of only ~3 distribution slots, and history
# rewriting does not un-publish it. These live on your machine and in GitHub
# Actions secrets, nowhere else.
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
*.cer
*.p8
*.csr
*.key
*.pem
*.b64
openssl-min.cnf

ios_dist.csr
ios_dist.key